{"availability":"available","full":"his1devil/chip-city","name":"chip-city","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":198,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-20T13:02:51Z","updated":"2026-07-21T15:53:18Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://zhanghuanyang.com/chip-city","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:23.351Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:23.351Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:23.351Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T04:29:46.504Z","stars":200,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T02:58:23.351Z","stars":198,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A living GitHub community where developer activity becomes light, growth, and low-pressure social connection.","Chip City turns contribution history into a shared cyberpunk city. Each developer owns a persistent district. Recent GitHub activity powers its lights and growth; quiet periods bring dim light and fog, but never erase what was built. Visitors can explore, give kudos, read project profiles, and customize their own neighborhood.","OpenAI Build Week 2026 entry · track: Apps for Your Life"],"features":["accumulated buildings represent durable history;","light represents recent activity;","absence changes the atmosphere but never destroys progress;","visits and kudos celebrate people without ranking their worth.","Activity-driven districts: public GitHub events produce capped daily credits, streaks, ON/DIM/FOG state, and visual growth."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/his1devil/chip-city/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e575e1b12bf69baaf710ec6955c772b6c02e637f32657ad4e7a4f924a658c63e","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:46.658Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:46.658Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A living GitHub community where developer activity becomes light, growth, and low-pressure social connection.","sourceUrl":